Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.01,0:00:04.54,PriPara,KaitouHibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}These coords are not for those \Nwho are undeserving to wear them.{consistency EP57}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.83,0:00:07.67,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't let you!{consistency EP57}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.67,0:00:08.71,PriPara,Dothy,0,0,0,,{\i1}How dare he!{consistency EP57}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.47,0:00:15.61,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:21.49,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,One of these days I'll get them back,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.49,0:00:26.52,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,and force the wrongdoer to regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:30.85,PriPara,Andou,0,0,0,,Master Hibiki,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:34.65,PriPara,Andou,0,0,0,,is placing the Summer Dream Coords on this pillar to your liking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:36.28,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.28,0:00:38.54,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,They'll come in handy in my future negotiations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:39.78,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,so it'd be best to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:43.53,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,The day's starting out well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:50.62,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And a good day for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:25.03,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Sion vs Hibiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:30.30,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:32.35,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,That restaurant's also your house, Dorothy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.35,0:02:34.23,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,It's just like my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.23,0:02:37.69,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,However, our Okonomiyaki restaurant is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:39.65,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.65,0:02:44.35,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,The Parajuku Fireworks Festival is happening along the Parajuku River tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:47.53,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Then we should go see the fireworks together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.53,0:02:48.66,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.99,0:02:51.62,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,What kind of yukata should I wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:56.86,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,You're all so carefree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:03:00.63,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You're going to be helping our restaurant out tomorrow, right, Sion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.27,0:03:03.09,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,I don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:05.38,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:08.47,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.47,0:03:10.06,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's Shikyouin's sheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.06,0:03:12.09,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Butler!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.41,0:03:17.64,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:28.28,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,My heart, which has been thinking of you, is but a single swan which has wandered from the flock...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.28,0:03:30.58,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,...and no longer has a place to return to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.58,0:03:33.70,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for you in Parajuku Park at 4PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:37.11,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:38.61,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,It could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.13,0:03:46.99,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:50.70,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want you to be my wings.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:53.09,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is to say, I would like to go on a date.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:54.80,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\fscx200}-{\fscx100} Shikyouin Hibiki{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.69,0:03:57.28,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Th-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.28,0:03:59.42,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,A date invitation?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:01.07,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,And from Shikyouin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:04.28,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Sion as wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:07.56,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Something like white and black?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:11.13,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],That'd be like some kind of Aroma and Mikan mixture!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.13,0:04:12.30,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,How silly!{Dummy!}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.25,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,This is why you're still a primary schooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:18.34,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Paprika Private Academy rule number 387:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.34,0:04:21.04,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,"Don't make fun of those who don't know any better!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:22.82,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You should be a role model!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:27.39,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,This is a love letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.39,0:04:28.62,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:31.92,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,One of those letters where you confess your love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:33.07,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.07,0:04:35.22,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,And Sion got one from Shikyouin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:37.69,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,A-Are you going to meet him, Sion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:38.96,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:39.88,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Sion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:40.90,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.23,0:04:42.18,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Did she...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:43.79,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,She went on the date!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:44.36,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:04:59.42,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Found her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:01.37,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,She made a swift decision, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:04.22,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,And their date is going to start after this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:06.10,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That's a surprise even from Sion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:10.53,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Maybe Shikyouin is going to have Sion take Fuwari's place as princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.53,0:05:11.76,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.76,0:05:14.26,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Sion doesn't fit the image of a princess at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:18.08,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've seen a date first hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:20.38,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,What does one do on a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:22.59,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:26.32,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,The two of them go out together and have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:27.93,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Go out together?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:29.47,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:30.99,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Gon! Go-Gon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:34.91,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Peck! Peck! Peck! Peck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:40.70,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}It seems that Sophy may have forgotten,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:46.28,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,[term fix],{\i1}but there's no mistaking that \Nthe acting headmaster was involved in that incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:49.44,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now there's this love letter...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:52.05,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:55.10,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}But he's not acting like your average deceitful guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:00.50,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:01.98,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,What? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:12.32,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Hold on to me tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:12.95,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Or you'll fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:20.59,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:25.86,PriPara_2,Rand1,0,0,0,,{bg}It's Shikyouin Hibiki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:26.93,PriPara_2,Rand2,0,0,0,,{bg}Where? Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.93,0:06:29.09,PriPara_2,Rand2,0,0,0,,{bg}He's here next to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.09,0:06:29.59,PriPara_2,Rand2,0,0,0,,{bg}Wow, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:30.28,PriPara_2,Rand2,0,0,0,,{bg}See them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:32.05,PriPara_2,Rand2,0,0,0,,{bg}Who is she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:34.13,PriPara_2,Rand2,0,0,0,,{bg}Wow! So beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:26.93,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,You made quite the brutish entrance, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.93,0:06:29.59,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,That's because I heard you're the forceful type.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:31.22,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.05,0:06:34.13,PriPara_2,Rand67,0,0,0,,{bg}Wow, look, it's Hibiki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:35.64,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Let's go somewhere where we can be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:37.85,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Then let's go to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.01,0:06:40.64,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,That's pretty bold of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.01,0:06:42.73,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,We don't have time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:44.31,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.31,0:06:46.31,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It would be best if you stopped saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.31,0:06:47.77,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:53.98,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I guess I'll overlook that because it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:55.37,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,After all, in the strictest sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:57.06,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,it's not a sentence-ender.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:58.78,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:04.48,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:07.21,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,If they keep going, they'll end up at Sion's place!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:09.67,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Sion's more daring than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:12.71,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,PriPara code number 49:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.71,0:07:16.97,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,"An idol's male-female relationships must be wholesome"!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:17.76,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.69,0:07:21.33,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:22.45,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,but capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.12,0:07:26.69,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Now then, let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.29,0:07:29.11,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:30.18,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Now strip!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:36.03,PriPara,Andou,0,0,0,,Master Hibiki only makes time \Nfor those who are intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:38.92,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,But we're here to see Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.79,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,This is Sion's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:45.25,PriPara,Andou,0,0,0,,However, Master Hibiki is \Non the other side of this door right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.00,PriPara,Andou,0,0,0,,Could any of you read this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:50.21,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:57.91,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,This is a high school level classical Chinese textbook...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:59.93,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,There's no way we'd be able to read this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:03.29,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,"The 16th year of King Keibun"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:04.89,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Wait, you can read it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:10.06,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lien Po was an able general of Chao who commanded the army against Chi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:13.07,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}and defeated its troops, taking the city of Yangsin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:18.38,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then he was made a chief minister and was known for his prowess to all the states.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:20.66,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Will that suffice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:22.62,PriPara,Andou,0,0,0,,You pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:24.47,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.47,0:08:26.23,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Clap clap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:29.33,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's not that hard if you know the symbols and tricks to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:31.54,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Now you'll let us through?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:32.90,PriPara,Andou,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:34.88,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.75,0:08:43.43,PriPara,Andou,0,0,0,,Master Hibiki only makes time for those who are athletic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:48.14,PriPara,Andou,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll let you pass if you score even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.98,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.98,0:08:51.61,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Stop screwing around with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:57.19,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Impressive...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:09:02.06,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,While we're doing this, Sion and Shikyouin are...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:10.12,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,My my...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:13.57,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,There seems to be a misunderstanding here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:14.85,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,What misunderstanding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:16.38,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,It must be this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:17.46,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,You're too sure of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:18.67,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:24.47,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Do continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.39,0:09:29.85,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.85,0:09:31.47,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Of one mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:37.65,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.11,0:09:43.07,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Perseverance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.81,0:09:46.90,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:49.53,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Show me more, Toudou Sion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:51.67,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I want to know more about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:54.29,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,That's what that challenge was about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.14,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:09:59.51,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Inviting me to a specific place at a specific time\N can be nothing other than a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:04.93,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It appears you lead a fairly strange life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:12.77,PriPara,Hion,0,0,0,,May the best player win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:14.86,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Love letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:18.07,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.59,0:10:23.53,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I suppose you could call it a letter asking about the black and white of your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.53,0:10:25.28,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I've taken an interest in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:28.63,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Would you mind lending me your power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:31.29,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Unfortunately I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:35.25,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,I have things to do with the girls I do PriPara with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.79,0:10:37.21,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.35,0:10:41.09,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Form a team,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:43.48,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],participate in the Autumn Dream Idol Grand Prix,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:44.94,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,and emerge victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.05,0:10:46.51,PriPara-Alt,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.94,0:10:46.51,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,That is my current goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:51.68,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,There's also recovering the Summer Dream Coords that were stolen from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:54.13,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Let's use our secret move!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:57.61,PriPara,Doona,0,0,0,,Ninja Monja Twin Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:04.89,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,After all, it's an important coord that was given to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:14.70,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And we were finally getting to the good part.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.38,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.38,0:11:17.44,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:19.21,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Gogogogogo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.21,0:11:19.90,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:23.38,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Gogogogogo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.64,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,And we're back to where we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:30.10,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It's exactly as I expected...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:34.56,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Toudou Sion, you are a true prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.79,0:11:48.91,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,What's with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.49,0:11:51.37,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It was a kiss of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:57.57,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,To be honest, I already know a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.67,0:12:02.28,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You can memorize a song or dance after only seeing it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:04.92,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Your tune,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.58,0:12:07.52,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Making Drama,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:09.14,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,stage outfits,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:11.60,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,and your idol rank...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:17.64,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Just how do you—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:20.15,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,There are other things I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.77,0:12:23.86,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Including something you've forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:26.40,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Something I forgot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:29.53,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And what you'll be in the future...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.19,0:12:33.54,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,If you want to know, tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.14,0:12:40.88,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Andou, my business here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.88,0:12:41.54,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:45.26,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:48.72,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Why did you invite Sion out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.27,0:12:50.67,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Love lettuce.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:12:58.19,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Sion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:13:00.56,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Well?! How'd it go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:03.93,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Tell us about your first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:05.90,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,"Date"? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.17,0:13:10.15,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,We were evenly matched.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:11.62,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,He was quite the opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.27,0:13:16.54,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Then it wasn't a date...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:21.18,PriPara_2,Rand1,0,0,0,,Wow! Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.21,0:13:42.58,PriPara_2,Rand5,0,0,0,,One sausage okonomiyaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.58,0:13:44.57,PriPara_2,Rand6,0,0,0,,One Hiroshima-style okonomiyaki please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:46.37,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Yes, one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.37,0:13:48.22,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Man, what happened to Sion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.22,0:13:50.50,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,She promised to help out at our stall!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.50,0:13:52.23,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What's she off doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:55.08,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Maybe she got lost in the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:02.50,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are other things I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:05.54,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}...something you've forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:07.92,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}And what you'll be in the future...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.22,0:14:23.10,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Hey, I see you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.56,0:14:26.58,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,What have I forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.58,0:14:27.82,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Come aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.19,0:14:42.21,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:47.36,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It's like we're flying above the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.36,0:14:50.17,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And the people are nothing more than dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.17,0:14:52.63,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,I-It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:56.80,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,I can see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:14:59.10,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,The idol teams shine on the Go board.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:01.73,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I see you've noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.41,0:15:06.31,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You girls are nothing but single stones \Nplaced upon the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:11.28,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,But I believe you have the ability to control that board.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:13.06,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:18.25,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I don't understand why you've decided to stay at the rank you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:20.95,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.01,0:15:25.12,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Why did you become an idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:28.84,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:32.94,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Speed is the essence of war!{naisho 13}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:35.55,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll start by defeating those three!{naisho 13}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:38.01,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sion will Go to war!{naisho 13}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.63,0:15:42.83,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:45.67,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,[term fix],I vowed to defeat SoLaMi SMILE...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:48.98,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,but now we're competing as friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:51.19,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Return to the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:53.90,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:56.99,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Weren't you aiming to become a Divine Idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:16:00.37,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,You're right, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.38,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Continuing like this will get you nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.38,0:16:07.58,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,How can you evolve and obtain a glorious future?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:10.67,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You understand, don't you, Toudou Sion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:15.76,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:18.48,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,You want to do a solo performance-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:19.68,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What's with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:20.92,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What about Reona and me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.92,0:16:23.14,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Are you quitting your team?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:24.92,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Is there something you don't like?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:28.77,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Are you not happy being in a team with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.77,0:16:30.18,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:33.23,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,I can perform with Dressing Pafé any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:38.00,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,I've never performed a solo concert like Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:41.52,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,I want to find out how far I can go on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:42.19,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:45.08,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,That's Sion. Always looking ahead-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:49.94,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,By increasing your individual strengths,\N you also strengthen the team-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:51.71,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'll go along with it-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.71,0:16:53.99,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,If that's the reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.99,0:16:57.32,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Besides, I'd love to see your solo concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:17:01.68,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,If you're both okay with it, go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.88,0:17:10.31,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Your new song has arrived-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:14.93,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,So you're entering on your own, Sion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:16.91,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This is the first time you've done a solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:18.53,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:24.33,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:27.04,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:30.43,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Since it's punk, we'll go with the Hard Eternal Punk Coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.43,0:17:35.02,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,But per Sion's request, PriPara has remade it with just black and white shades.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.02,0:17:37.93,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Eternal Black or White Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.93,0:17:38.90,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.35,0:17:44.98,PriPara_2,Rand1,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for your solo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.98,0:17:46.94,PriPara_2,Rand2,0,0,0,,Good luck, Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.94,0:17:48.52,PriPara_2,Rand3,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:50.44,PriPara,Lesagi,0,0,0,,Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:52.48,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:01.60,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Back to square one.{consistency above}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.60,0:18:03.34,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Return to the battlefield.{consistency above}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.34,0:18:06.19,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll hone my sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:08.45,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,{\i1}and aim to be a Divine Idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:28.33,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:31.50,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:36.50,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Rockin' Rockin' Rock-n-Roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.39,0:19:41.00,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.29,0:19:43.59,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:50.01,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Rockin' Jet Show On Air!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.98,0:19:53.86,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:19:58.40,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Go Uncompromising Life-form!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:19:59.57,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:01.02,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.79,0:20:44.54,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You got a lot of likes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:48.85,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Sion has ranked up to the Major Class's Famous Idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:50.12,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.61,0:20:57.59,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Sion is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.59,0:20:59.28,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,This isn't our normal Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:01.04,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We can't let our guard down-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:06.23,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,That was wonderful, Sion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.23,0:21:09.97,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,W-Well, I suppose that was better than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.41,0:21:13.62,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Now the two of us will need to put on a concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.62,0:21:15.44,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,We're steadily getting there-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:19.19,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,One by one we'll level up to Top Idol-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.79,0:21:21.15,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's aim to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:22.82,PriPara,Dressingpafe,0,0,0,,...Divine Idols together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:34.24,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Now then, who's next?
